#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For workflows that require many single-qubit $R_X(\\theta)$ or two-qubit rotations (such as in a variational ansatz or when simulating the time evolution of quantum systems), this constraint causes the circuit depth to grow rapidly. However, fractional gates remove this requirement, because the single- and two-qubit rotations are executed directly, and create a more efficient (and thus error-suppressed) quantum circuit.\n"
"<span id=\"when-not-to-use\"></span>\n"
"<span id=\"when-not-to-use-fractional-gates\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa mga workflow na nangangailangan ng maraming single-qubit na $R_X(\\theta)$ o two-qubit na rotation (tulad ng sa isang variational ansatz o kapag sinesimulate ang time evolution ng mga quantum system), ang limitasyong ito ay nagdudulot ng mabilis na paglaki ng lalim ng circuit. Gayunpaman, inaaalis ng mga fractional gate ang kinakailangang ito, dahil ang mga single- at two-qubit na rotation ay direktang isinasagawa, na lumilikha ng mas mahusay (at samakatuwid ay mas kaunting error) na quantum circuit.\n"
"<span id=\"when-not-to-use\"></span>\n"
"<span id=\"when-not-to-use-fractional-gates\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "When *not* to use fractional gates {#when-not-to-use-fractional-gates}"
msgstr "Kailan *hindi* dapat gamitin ang mga fractional gate {#when-not-to-use-fractional-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is important to note that fractional gates are an *experimental* feature and the behavior of the `use_fractional_gates` flag may change in the future. Look to the [release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) for new versions of `qiskit-ibm-runtime` for more information. See also the API reference documentation for [QiskitRuntimeService.backend](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend), which describes `use_fractional_gates`.\n"
msgstr "Mahalagang tandaan na ang mga fractional gate ay isang *experimental* na feature at ang gawi ng `use_fractional_gates` flag ay maaaring magbago sa hinaharap. Tingnan ang [mga release note](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) para sa mga bagong bersyon ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime` para sa karagdagang impormasyon. Tingnan din ang API reference documentation para sa [QiskitRuntimeService.backend](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend), na naglalarawan ng `use_fractional_gates`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additionally, the Qiskit transpiler has limited capability to use $R_{ZZ}(\\theta)$ in its optimization passes. This requires you to take more care in crafting and optimizing circuits that contain these instructions.\n"
msgstr "Bukod pa rito, ang Qiskit transpiler ay may limitadong kakayahan na gamitin ang $R_{ZZ}(\\theta)$ sa mga optimization pass nito. Kailangan mong maging mas maingat sa paggawa at pag-optimize ng mga circuit na naglalaman ng mga instruksyong ito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Lastly, using fractional gates is not supported for:\n"
"- [Pauli twirling](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pauli-twirling) - however, [measurement twirling with TREX](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex) *is* supported.\n"
"- [Probabilistic error cancellation](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-cancellation-pec)\n"
"- [Zero-noise extrapolation (using probabilistic error amplification)](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea)\n"
msgstr ""
"Panghuli, hindi sinusuportahan ang paggamit ng mga fractional gate para sa:\n"
"- [Pauli twirling](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pauli-twirling) - gayunpaman, ang [measurement twirling gamit ang TREX](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex) *ay* sinusuportahan.\n"
"- [Probabilistic error cancellation](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-cancellation-pec)\n"
"- [Zero-noise extrapolation (gamit ang probabilistic error amplification)](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read the guide on [primitive options](/guides/runtime-options-overview) to learn more about customizing the error mitigation and suppression techniques for a given quantum workload.\n"
msgstr "Basahin ang gabay sa [mga primitive option](/guides/runtime-options-overview) para matuto pa tungkol sa pag-customize ng mga error mitigation at suppression technique para sa isang partikular na quantum workload.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Which backends support fractional gates? {#which-backends-support-fractional-gates}"
msgstr "Aling mga backend ang sumusuporta sa fractional gates? {#which-backends-support-fractional-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Not all backends support fractional gates. Run `service.backends(use_fractional_gates=True)` to find those that do. With the release of `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.48, you can also run `service.least_busy(fractional_gates=True)` to find the least-busy backend that supports fractional gates. A fake backend supports fractional gates only if the related \"real\" backend supports them.\n"
msgstr "Hindi lahat ng backend ay sumusuporta sa fractional gates. Patakbuhin ang `service.backends(use_fractional_gates=True)` para mahanap ang mga sumusuporta nito. Sa paglabas ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.48, maaari mo ring patakbuhin ang `service.least_busy(fractional_gates=True)` para mahanap ang pinaka-hindi-busy na backend na sumusuporta sa fractional gates. Ang isang fake backend ay sumusuporta sa fractional gates lamang kung sinusuportahan ito ng kaugnay na \"tunay\" na backend.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that fake backends don't support fractional gates by default, since fractional gates are disabled by default. To enable fractional gates on a fake backend that supports them, refresh its configuration.\n"
msgstr "Tandaan na ang mga fake backend ay hindi sumusuporta sa fractional gates bilang default, dahil naka-disable ang fractional gates bilang default. Para paganahin ang fractional gates sa isang fake backend na sumusuporta rito, i-refresh ang configuration nito.\n"

